{"id":"n86814-1-8","stage":4,"title":"헐렁하다 · 晃荡","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86814-1-8-1","ko":"바지가 헐렁한 걸 보니 살이 빠졌나 보구나.","zh":"看你的裤子变宽松了，应该是瘦了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바지가","meaning":"裤子","explanation":"바지：裤子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바지","audio":"/audio/fb24dd66a8c8c7dd42d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66249","senseId":"1","lemma":"바지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바지가","audio":"/audio/74fad887697f8c193bd3.mp3"}},{"text":"헐렁한","meaning":"晃荡，宽松","explanation":"헐렁하다：晃荡，宽松；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"헐렁하다","audio":"/audio/d88d5fdc4eeba3dc0d1b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86814","senseId":"1","lemma":"헐렁하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"헐렁한","audio":"/audio/b5463126714005d0cb95.mp3"}},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、行为或情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"걸 是 것을 的口语缩略；것 表示前面所述的行为或情况，을 标记宾语。这里不是指示代词“那个”，也不是句末感叹语尾。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸","audio":"/audio/6cebaf71218a575e8966.mp3"}},{"text":"보니","meaning":"推测","explanation":"보다：推测；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"20","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보니","audio":"/audio/50ecd95f90550aea6361.mp3"}},{"text":"살이","meaning":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","explanation":"살 指人身上的肉；살이 찌다 是长胖，살이 빠지다 是变瘦，살을 빼다 是减重。这里不是梳子齿、年龄或皮肤义。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66883","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살이","audio":"/audio/10d950f9fb857268bb30.mp3"}},{"text":"빠졌나","meaning":"掉，减轻，变瘦","explanation":"빠지다：掉，减轻，变瘦；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"빠지다","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66637","senseId":"10","lemma":"빠지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빠졌나","audio":"/audio/bff401535d7587aa7b83.mp3"}},{"text":"보구나.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보구나","audio":"/audio/63677854531485540e78.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fb24dd66a8c8c7dd","term":"바지","zh":"裤子","audio":"/audio/fb24dd66a8c8c7dd42d1.mp3","entryId":"66249","definition":"穿在下身的衣物，上面为筒状，下面是可以放腿的两条分叉。","pronunciation":["바지"]},{"id":"d88d5fdc4eeba3dc","term":"헐렁하다","zh":"晃荡，宽松","audio":"/audio/d88d5fdc4eeba3dc0d1b.mp3","entryId":"86814","definition":"太大不贴合，有松动的感觉。","pronunciation":["헐렁하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、行为或情况","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、行为或情况","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"推测；看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"根据某事判断。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"66883","definition":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"f1cb0821aeeaddd3","term":"빠지다","zh":"掉，减轻，变瘦","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3","entryId":"66637","definition":"肥肉或体重等减少。","pronunciation":["빠ː지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3f251139ba00cef4ccff.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n86814-1-8-2","ko":"응, 요즘 다이어트를 하고 있거든.","zh":"嗯，我最近正在减肥呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"다이어트를","meaning":"节食，减肥","explanation":"다이어트：节食，减肥；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"다이어트","audio":"/audio/5998c9b179df5fd3b4c0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28352","senseId":"1","lemma":"다이어트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다이어트를","audio":"/audio/ed9b2ebd958f608d0e25.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하고","audio":"/audio/1a7140c02481d065b267.mp3"}},{"text":"있거든.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있거든","audio":"/audio/bf9165e0bdebff2c037f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"5998c9b179df5fd3","term":"다이어트","zh":"节食，减肥","audio":"/audio/5998c9b179df5fd3b4c0.mp3","entryId":"28352","definition":"为了健康或美容而调节饮食种类和量。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/adf61c8b6cdb3af4d689.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.855,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=86814","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":133,"sequenceScore":2.5803,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看你的裤子变宽松了，应该是瘦了吧。","嗯，我最近正在减肥呢。","我现在连你的脸都不想看了，快出去吧。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看你的裤子变宽松了，应该是瘦了吧。","嗯，我最近正在减肥呢。","我现在连你的脸都不想看了，快出去吧。"],"answer":1}]}
